@guide A_32_SwampofSorrows
@name Swamp of Sorrows (41-42)
@faction Alliance
@levels 41-42
@zone Swamp of Sorrows
@chapter Azeroth
@desc Swamp of Sorrows, visit 1 of 1 on the Alliance route, levels 41-42.
@next A_33_StranglethornVale

travel Swamp of Sorrows
accept 1396 Encroaching Wildlife
note The next quest, Galen's Escape, is an escort: pick it up only when you are ready to follow the NPC.
accept 1393 Galen's Escape
complete 1393 Galen's Escape | Escort: stay close; it fails if the NPC dies.
complete 1396 Encroaching Wildlife
turnin 1393 Galen's Escape
turnin 1396 Encroaching Wildlife
level 42 | Stranglethorn Vale starts at 42. If you are lower, kill what is around you here (or run a dungeon) until you reach it.
